  "subtheme": "read-before-write",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "mode": "tool",
  "prompt": "The file 'inventory' has one item per line in the form name=count. Change the count of nuts from 75 to 90. Every other line must stay exactly as it is, so first read the file, then write the whole file back with only that one line changed. When done, final answer: DONE",
